cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Math Map: a knowledge map from counting to the octonions"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, dependency-free map of mathematics from primary school to
  undergraduate level: eleven views, 166 cells, 157 definitions and a
  127-entry timeline, with a companion fitting lab that identifies the
  family a hand-drawn curve most likely belongs to.
